body:
Could you explain the use-cases where this is better than:

```html
<div id="sidebar">
  <div id="brands"></div>
  <div id="price"></div>
</div>
```

```javascript
instantsearch.widgets.refinementList({
  container: '#brands',
  facetName: 'brands',
  operator: 'and'
});
instantsearch.widgets.refinementList({
  container: '#price',
  facetName: 'price',
  operator: 'or'
});
```

I remember this had to do with the Magento/WP implementation, but I don't remember why.
